{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.tenka.oversleep",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她今天没来上课",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.tenka.oversleep",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.tenka.oversleep",
    "idolId": "tenka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯……甜花的电话，打了也没人接。家里电话也一样……）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（来路上出了什么事吗？……先直接去她家看看吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……甜花，我进来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……甜花，我进来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "诶……？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "啊……制作人先生……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "诶……为什么……在家里……？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "来叫なーちゃん……？还是，家长面谈……？甜花，是不是哪里做得不好……？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，都不是……不过你没事就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "甜花没来上课，所以我来接你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "诶……诶……？课是明天吧……我记得……手机上，也记了……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "是、是今天……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "对不起，制作人先生……甜花……以为是明天……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……情况我明白了。总之，现在赶紧去上课吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "可、可是……现在去的话……迟到……老师会不会生气……？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可能会被说几句吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "呜哇……！果、果然……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，迟到的事我已经联络过了。如果被说，那时候我也一起道歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "制作人先生，也……？那……我、我去试试……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。我在外面等着，准备好了就出来。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说回来……记错日期没办法，但电话总得接吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我还担心甜花出了什么事呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "对不起……给制作人先生添麻烦了……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "那个……手机响的时候，甜花在睡觉……没注意到……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "醒来之后想回电，可是……因为休息……就觉得，算了吧……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……不过今后，注意到了就马上回。我也会担心。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嗯……会那样做的……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个先放一边。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "甜花平时，穿得相当松弛啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "啊呜……那个是……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "因为舒服……在家里，一直都是……那样……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "反正不太出门……就觉得，也可以吧……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不出门的话，确实会变成那样……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "制作人先生要来……甜花没想到……所以……",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "确实，突然进房间的是我。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……差不多到练习场了。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……对不起，都是甜花害的……",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也会有弄错的时候。彼此彼此。比起那个，做好觉悟了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嗯、嗯……会好好道歉……和制作人先生，一起……",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……谢谢你，制作人先生。"
      }
    }
  },
